      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>By default, a save request is automatically triggered once the Activity finishes. If this flag is set, finishing the activity doesn't trigger a save request.</para>
          <para>This flag is typically used in conjunction with Builder.setTriggerId(AutofillId).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/service/autofill/SaveInfo#FLAG_DONT_SAVE_ON_FINISH" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.service.autofill.SaveInfo.FLAG_DONT_SAVE_ON_FINISH</code>.</a></format></para>
